r:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_blank</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              axis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ticks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">top </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Which produces this plot:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/26345cdedf618/Rplot01.jpeg?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Rplot01.jpeg\" width=\"320\" height=\"199\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">But I want something with tick marks similar to this one:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/26345cdedf618/Untitled.jpg?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Untitled.jpg\" width=\"188\" height=\"200\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Any help getting the x-axis tick orientation switched?</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Thanks!!</p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div></div>"
